       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PTEXP.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
           COPY PT-CPY.
       01  WS-MONTHS           PIC 9(2).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE PT-EXPIRE-MONTHS TO WS-MONTHS.
           IF WS-MONTHS > PT-CAMP-MONTHS
               CALL 'PTNOTI'
           END-IF.
           GOBACK.
